{"case": "ben-change-email-claude", "attempt": 0, "started_at": 1793550700.5020165, "status": 200, "latency_s": 1.4295, "ttft_s": null, "answered_model": "claude-haiku-5-5", "answer": "Most online services let you change your email from the account settings page, usually under \"Profile,\" \"Account,\" or \"Security\"; you'll typically need to enter your current password and then confirm the change by clicking a verification link or code sent to the new address. If you can't find the option, check the service's help center for \"change email address\" or \"update contact information.\"", "headers": {"x-kong-llm-model": "gemini/claude-haiku-5-5", "x-kong-request-id": "cfa03723dcb946168d909860057dc61e"}, "error": null, "expected": true, "mismatch": [], "classification": "passed"}
